---
manual: events.click
lines: [2187, 2193]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: E8
----------- app code
# A press on something with no click block goes on to the topmost drawable under the
# pointer that has one, as Shoes 3's shoes_canvas_send_click2 skips what has none: a label
# drawn over a clickable oval does not swallow the click.
$clicks = []
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 120 do
  @oval = oval 100, 60, 80, center: true, fill: orange
  stack left: 60, top: 53, width: 80 do
    @label = para "click me", align: "center", size: 12, margin: 0
  end
  @oval.click { |button, left, top| $clicks << [button, left, top] }
end
----------- test code
click_at 100, 90
assert_equal [[1, 100, 90]], $clicks, "the oval hears a click below the label"
click_at 100, 58
assert_equal [1, 100, 58], $clicks.last, "and one on the label itself"
assert_equal 2, $clicks.size
